"altzodiacstart.input.factor.header"    = "Start factor";
"altzodiacstart.input.factor.nofactors" = "No factors selected in the configuration.";
"altzodiacstart.input.help"             = "Choose the factor whose position marks the start (0°) of an alternative zodiac. You can choose any factor that is selected in the configuration.\n\nThe houses, the Ascendant, the MC and the positions of the factors stay unchanged; only the division into signs shifts, using the chosen factor as the new start of the first sign.\n\nThe result is shown on the right and updates immediately when you choose another factor.";

