"altzodiacstart.help"               = "This screen has two tabs. The 'Positions' tab lists, for every point in the horoscope, its original position and its position in the alternative zodiac, which starts at the factor you chose on the left. The row of that factor is highlighted.\n\nThe 'Wheel' tab shows the chart wheel with the sign ring shifted so sign 1 (Aries) starts at the chosen factor. An extra line marks the exact position of that factor. Houses, Ascendant, MC and the positions of the factors stay unchanged.\n\nWith the buttons at the top right you can switch to black and white, hide the aspects and export the wheel as a PNG or PDF file.";

